    "title": "Who made it to national championship game? Schedule, where to watch, tickets, NCAA bracket",
    "text": "April 4, 2026, 11:32 p.m. ETThe 2026 NCAA men's basketball championship will be played in Indianapolis at Lucas Oil Stadium.Michigan will face UConn in the national championship game on Monday, April 6, 2026.UConn advanced to the final by defeating Illinois, while Michigan beat Arizona.The 2026 Final Four national championship game is set for Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis. The NCAA men's basketball tournament March Madness game on Monday, April 6, will be shown on TBS.Here's what you need to know about the weekend, the 2026 March Madness bracket, odds, picks and predictions:What channel is Michigan basketball vs Connecticut game on TV Monday, April 6? How to watch UConn-Michigan basketball March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament Final Four national championship game liveThe Michigan vs UConn game will play on TBS at 8:50 p.m. ET, Monday, April 6, 2026.Watch NCAA tournament action on SlingStream the Michigan vs Connecticut game on TV Monday, April 6? How to watch Michigan vs UConn basketball March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament Final Four national championship game liveThe UConn vs. Michigan game will stream via SlingTV at 8:50 pm. ET, Monday, April 6, 2026. Fans can download SlingTV in the Apple App Store or on Google Play. Final Four 2026 results in March Madness NCAA Tournament actionConnecticut Huskies 71, Illinois Fighting Illini 62 | Box scoreMichigan Wolverines 91, Arizona Wildcats 73 | Box score2025-2026 Michigan Wolverines regular season record, Big Ten conference recordMichigan Wolverines: (36-3, 19-1 Big Ten)2025-2026 Connecticut Huskies regular season record, Big East conference recordUConn Huskies: (34-5, 17-3 Big East)How much are national championship Final Four tickets? How much do national championship Final Four tickets cost at Lucas Oil Stadium on Monday, April 6?Check Final Four ticket availability on StubHub2026 NCAA tournament odds for March Madness bracket betting: BetMGMVisit www.in.betmgm.com for the latest odds of every NCAA tournament men's basketball game.2026 March Madness bracket picks, predictions for NCAA tournament men's basketballCompare your March Madness bracket to the USA Today experts. See every pick from 10 different brackets.Our editors independently choose our recommendations. Some content is produced with paid support from a third party, however our editorial decisions remain independent. If you buy through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices and availability may change.",
